gated_scan and cumdecay in all precision variants. Hides FMA/MUL latency
and doubles memory-level parallelism on the A57.

Additional speedup over OpenMP baseline (Qwen3.5-4B, 4096 ch):
  cumdecay:      829→513 us (1.62×)  total 4.11× vs serial
  gated_scan:   1501→985 us (1.52×)  total 3.95× vs serial
  cumdecay_bf16: 641→367 us (1.75×)
  gated_scan_bf16: 1553→977 us (1.59×)
  cumdecay_f16:  607→353 us (1.72×)
  gated_scan_f16: 1549→1015 us (1.53×)

Conv unchanged (already compute-dense, no unroll applied).
Tests: bit-identical to serial reference." 2>&1

